{"id":"n60931-1-19","stage":0,"title":"나 · 我","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60931-1-19-1","ko":"나만 자리에 앉아 있어도 괜찮겠어?","zh":"只有我坐着也没关系吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나만","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나만","audio":"/audio/94653aba30449d7af9cc.mp3"}},{"text":"자리에","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리에","audio":"/audio/70904ab00b52ac53f12f.mp3"}},{"text":"앉아","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉아","audio":"/audio/709a1afa79c56d9a698a.mp3"}},{"text":"있어도","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어도","audio":"/audio/c58eb3e843e5a2844f83.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮겠어?","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮겠어","audio":"/audio/c452806f76f9856a0003.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryI